# --- JWT keys ---
# Private signing keys are never committed. Only the labelled test-only pairs in users
# and edge (src/test/resources/test-*.pem, see TEST-ONLY-KEYS.md) are allowed. Product
# security rule authorised by Phase 2 CONTEXT; local tooling stays in .git/info/exclude.
*.pem
app/keys/dev/
!app/services/users/src/test/resources/test-*.pem
!app/edge/src/test/resources/test-*.pem
javac.*.args

# --- GCP / SSH keys ---
# infra/secrets/ holds the GCP service-account key (gcp-key.json) and the SSH key pair
# made by `just keys`. Neither is ever committed; see infra/terraform/README.md.
infra/secrets/
